    <guid isPermaLink="false">699b353aa22480add6bae3f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过年好呀！给大家拜个晚年！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目是主播苏西两周前和身边几个兼职做乐队的小伙伴一起录制的。经常看到他们发排练、演出、录音的动态，很好奇这是一种怎样的体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>隆重介绍</span><strong><span>Chariots Overdrive 🙌👏🎉</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="https://chariotsoverdrive.bandcamp.com/album/the-end-of-antiquity" data-url="https://chariotsoverdrive.bandcamp.com/album/the-end-of-antiquity"><span>Bandcamp</span></a><span> &nbsp;| &nbsp;</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/7uBx59vCYmkZJgnvWahru0" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/artist/7uBx59vCYmkZJgnvWahru0"><span>Spotify</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>与此同时，这也是我们第一次尝试线下录制。准备仓促，发现所谓双向收音的麦克风还是一个方向收音最好😅 音量有点不均衡希望大家多包涵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：苏西</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chariots Overdrive</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>G.H.Z</span></strong><span> - 主唱 / 节奏吉他</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Y.Z</span></strong><span> - 主音吉他</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Z.Z.Y</span></strong><span> - 贝斯</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>W.R.C</span></strong><span> - 鼓手</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chariots Overdrive - Chariots Overdrive</span></p>]]></description>
