    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXs9qkz4oXPJR1Qg59ZZQKtA_Rs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊一聊留子们做饭和吃饭的故事，本期有快手菜食谱，美味调料包种草和做饭小tips随机掉落，希望大家食用愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面来自嘉宾小锅的下厨相册</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播及嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿烫 鲈鱼粥 马队长 Monica 秋浦猿 苏西 小锅 雪哥哥 粥哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">00:03:24</a> 为了吃中餐前往法国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">00:15:06</a> N人和S人的买菜风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">00:27:01</a> 顶级J人的Costco使用指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">00:34:28</a> 剥蒜的学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2523">00:42:03</a> 有些菜这辈子只想做一次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3385">00:56:25</a> 国外各地中餐水平大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3938">00:65:38</a> 大家烧烤都烤点儿啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4694">01:18:14</a> 菜谱推荐和酱料种草！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5827">01:37:07</a> 谁年轻的时候没炸过几次厨房</span></p>]]></description>
