  <item>
    <title>退休以后我要去学天体物理——聊聊养生与养老</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6850d6bb4abe6e29cb82389a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6850d6bb4abe6e29cb82389a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jun 2025 02:59:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目我们聊了聊养生和养老。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听前声明：本期节目提到的养生观点都是嘉宾的个人心得，不构成任何专业建议。如果大家有任何身体或者心理上的担忧，还是要及时就医。希望大家都能有健康的身体和好心情！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">00:03:06</a>:你从什么时候开始感觉到“初老”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">00:14:32</a>:睡不着，醒得早</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">00:27:34</a>:吃饭吃太快全都怪遗传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">00:36:17</a>:莫名其妙的疼痛和湿疹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2688">00:44:48</a>:你会给自己立“生前遗嘱”吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">00:50:52</a>:不要想太远，就当替我们谈一场恋爱吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">00:58:09</a>:上班太累了，我想提前退休</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3926">01:05:26</a>:退休以后我要学天体物理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4185">01:09:45</a>:体检就像鬼打墙，最后还是看基因？</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：鲈鱼粥</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：阿烫，Bruce，Beta，马队长，马哥，Mia，苏西，雪哥哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：鲈鱼粥</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣发：苏西，Max小麦</span></p>]]></description>
