  <item>
    <title>吃顿饭顺便来点内耗？聊聊小费文化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682a2098457b22ce0d548f55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682a2098457b22ce0d548f55</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 May 2025 18:05:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hey hey 天南海北各个时区的时好时差听众朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见！大家都好吗～北半球春暖花开了，南半球看起来也是很丰盛的季节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，我们来小聊小费文化，目的是探寻，在服务业的动态里，小费到底扮演了怎样的角色？是激励员工还是分散经营者成本？各个国家的小费文化又有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在旅途中给小费很爽快的</span><strong><span>苏西</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>当过餐厅老板给后厨分小费的</span><strong><span>粥哥Will</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>认为给小费代表了中国形象的</span><strong><span>马队长</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>干过服务业但也不情愿给小费的</span><strong><span>野三</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>很会上价值的暂时征服AI的</span><strong><span>Modern</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>不会开车却共情代驾的</span><strong><span>小鲈</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 服务业对你之后给小费/好评的行为会有影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 原来美国的服务业时薪这么低？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 苏西：酒店服务员给我写了个大写的TIPS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 服务员碰到I人，是服务你呢还是不服务你呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 野三：打车到了目的地，司机递过来一个pos机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> Modern：在自助餐厅花了最爽的一笔小费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 如果提前告知你所有需要收小费的项目，你还愿意去吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 为了一个干净的厕所，你愿意花多少钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">01:01:40</a> 小鲈：我的小费逻辑是情绪价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3895">01:04:55</a> 马队：给小费的一瞬间我代表中国人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">01:07:35</a> 朝鲜的英文不是North Korea？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4235">01:10:35</a> 你会给AI服务员小费吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4475">01:14:35</a> 小费会改变国内服务业的戾气吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：鲈鱼粥</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：鲈鱼粥</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣发：苏西，小麦</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62cad50ccaf3c2748a42b615/lva4CaWRuwtGEArFmZDOpGPWwVmr.m4a" length="121249865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:32</itunes:duration>
