  <item>
    <title>不仅玩桌游暴露人性，聊桌游也能暴露人性！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649aec5ad6cdb597287fffcd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649aec5ad6cdb597287fffcd</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jun 2023 14:04:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>转眼之间，时好时差（或者原本的“谐聊粉丝的谐聊会”）这个节目节目开始快一年了。回想一下关于谐聊海外二群的记忆，聚会游戏或者说桌游绝对是我们相遇相知的重要角色。从让人睡不着的海龟汤到造梗神器Gartic phone，从鲈老师心心念念的拉密牌到马队带动的血染钟楼，桌游让一群陌生人熟悉彼此，了解到对方“不为人知”的一面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们聊了聊大家玩过的桌游，或者更宽泛一些的聚会游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 东北孩子桌游启蒙是“嘎拉哈”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 男生比女生更喜欢三国杀？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 醉翁之意不在Jenga</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> 真心话大冒险居然能骗人吗？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 狼人杀的黑话都是什么意思啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 海南的国王游戏比较适合澡堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 一些“适合”破冰的桌游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a> 有些剧本杀能不能不要这么离谱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4520">75:20</a> 桌游里暴露的隐藏性格</span></p><span></span><p><span>--</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：苏西</span></p><span></span><p><span>插话师：小鲈 野三 张洋 小麦 大鹅&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：苏西</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣发：苏西 小麦</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Riviera - Smith The Mister</span></p><span></span><p><span>LET THE GAMES BEGIN - AJR</span></p>]]></description>
